{"id": "EUVD-2026-72457", "enisaUuid": "c257d3e5-ff1c-3a73-951c-5815e8967379", "description": "A flaw was found in 389 Directory Server. During SASL PLAIN authentication, a stale identity carried in a Cyrus SASL auxiliary property from a prior failed bind attempt can be installed on a connection following a subsequent, unrelated successful bind, regardless of which SASL mechanism completes that second bind. An attacker can send a SASL PLAIN bind as cn=Directory Manager with an incorrect password, then complete a SASL ANONYMOUS bind on the same connection, causing the server to grant Directory Manager authority without any valid credentials. A variant using a valid low-privileged account's own successful bind instead of an anonymous one is also possible.", "datePublished": "2026-09-07T14:14:53", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T14:14:57", "baseScore": 9.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64771", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64776", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64778", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64779", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64780", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64781", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64783", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64784", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64785", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64789", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64790", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64791", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64792", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64793", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64804", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:64811", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:79217", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-18922", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2511388"], "aliases": ["GHSA-pr87-24g5-hphv", "CVE-2026-18922"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.56, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "027e746b-1446-3661-9c31-7ffce4d492fb", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8.8 Telecommunications Update Service", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 8080020260831180218.6dbb3803"}, {"id": "0d26b262-5f09-3a4c-b5e0-5082c2f47c83", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9.2 Update Services for SAP Solutions", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0:2.2.4-22.el9_2"}, {"id": "151b429f-18d5-3be4-84ed-0885f7023dd5", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Directory Server 12.2 E4S for RHEL 9", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 9020020260903155914.1674d574"}, {"id": "16333c1d-83db-3cc6-9bce-75c69158aab6", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8.8 Update Services for SAP Solutions", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 8080020260831180218.6dbb3803"}, {"id": "5eb1ca9f-b507-3435-9a93-a7645ef717d6", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Directory Server 12.4 E4S for RHEL 9", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 9040020260903102623.1674d574"}, {"id": "6662bccf-3ca5-3d0a-a57d-96bae813fca5", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Directory Server 11.7 E4S for RHEL 8", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 8080020260903102346.f969626e"}, {"id": "841f9eee-596b-3f3e-8e49-bf7fae0f8ef4", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8.6 Extended Update Support Long-Life Add-On", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 8060020260901145727.824efc52"}, {"id": "895e7893-a902-341d-ad07-6118e344e692", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 10.0 Extended Update Support", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0:3.0.6-21.el10_0"}, {"id": "8b1214c8-d0ff-3a60-b49a-420ac9afde03", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 8100020260904155442.25e700aa"}, {"id": "8b3ce7a3-3aba-